  usecase "Valider Panier" as C10
  usecase "Payer Commande" as C11
  usecase "Historique Commandes" as C12
  usecase "Annuler Commande" as C13
  usecase "Prendre RDV" as C14
  usecase "Voir Créneaux" as C15
  usecase "Payer RDV" as C16
  usecase "Historique RDV" as C17
